OL,3,GEast Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FA cloudy
OL,6,Fnight, with most places experiencing
OL,7,Foutbreaks of rain at some point. A
OL,8,Flight easterly breeze inland, with the
OL,9,Fwind strengthening along the coast by
OL,10,FTuesday morning.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTuesday:FCloudy with outbreaks of rain
OL,13,Ffor most of the day, although eastern
OL,14,Fparts will see a drier interlude.
OL,15,FRemaining windy along the coast.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
