OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Wednesday to Friday:
OL,6,FTurning increasingly wet on Wednesday,
OL,7,Fwith some places experiencing heavy or
OL,8,Fprolonged rain. Drier with sunny
OL,9,Fspells on Thursday, clouding over by
OL,10,Fthe evening. Heavy rain and strong
OL,11,Fwinds Friday.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
